  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/cJrCLd4mvBMrB4XNHx5z6sYxDXbRN95BmAoTRoDQpkE59soE7YXZ8SWCqemIZ7YOIQenb4XNV5RwUXaW1cYGC07fXZ2Q9KZYqtQPpUpAsQpVPHp5bwhbVyTVbyKBofitm6Cd5Svgokrv9vkY6ejqSAliGaZpN7MnJk3VSX01X2M70gIihSpsn6RLhhCQUGqroBUFZQ1k\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/14/13b31f52e609dc31b87cc09cf4ae6750..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんとなんと！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">アイコンが変わりました</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">中学生からの魔法学校のお友達に</div>\n<div align=\"center\">描いてもらったよ～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ちょうかわいい～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">天才すごいよ～😭</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとに～😭</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今までアイコンにしてたイラストは</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私が描いたやつなんですけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ギリギリ女すぎて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">Twitterが始動する前日くらいに</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">急いで完成させた気がする</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/LSZ28pUtF6F1jq21JYdVzCXRDmedL2FTAodxijuwvfmzPVz0LGAASBlLkMh8CIb2m6PI3LoF4PuvIQ6ZYjQ2axczlOYgtmuNuNb83F2907BoNmwFqhfi8TbMFNKGbAtZwhtoVLO9bNKEQ86GMrPZSPPowsY68723X68ARSWJnIMVGvSkGYgbxzGz5S0cMdBnaW5CdiuF\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/14/7a1622655dc45c240cb845bc9d890dd2..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんか色塗りが永遠に古い</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">絵うまくなりたーい;;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/NIykFt4GwvuaSHp3B7RdF7Jbp7bywTGRDR33Zdi0eHjso7T09odPhlPgoVSuSN1dV5QMennRpZILzjqBroQ3RgxrBhJk2TlI3R4k51IFYSNHkGrKQumJdA0CXDAZwUHunljcezr2ZpFu0qGaKurtZ5PWK1yaQUq2fw6nqmH3CR8YGAmMc2Lk8EvT5cU6TtH6mss7xPwc\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/14/ad10a445534fd1698e11ce9835eb1f23..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/JNkEgnG0yEwBPMCx6BBOM90N1wh58iUnm5kjMQwC0kFPIt06r2EInHJnoHgKRwlc3zmgvxi9GjQ67YhtDqRnbWQ2GihRu0OBvyNUdHobxsAjcX52pw71lKTYaoTZl0Y1SR8WhICge7HapWb4QvScVZXMoxFpsB5xuCfhslQ8rYau8YbKIdm6FdxqKVil5n9Gry2Z6Jxx\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/14/351b423a22317607be7bea1db3ddde9f..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ここら辺はボツになったやつ！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">絵描くの楽しいけど、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ラテになった途端</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">下手くそになるのなんだろう</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">みんな優しいから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">うまい！かわいい！って言ってくれる</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">わたしはうれしいです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">もっとうまく描けるようにがんばる！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">私のためにご帰宅してくれたりFAとか描いてくださったり、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私のために時間使ってもらえるって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとに当たり前じゃないし</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">沢山の感謝しかないなって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">これまでもこれからも思ってます</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">みんなありがとう ( T . T )~</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">そしてそして</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">明日のお給仕は</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おーぷん～真下</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">です！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ご帰宅お待ちしております🎶</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おやすみー＞ω＜！</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
